5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I believe we need to evaluate the actual impact of previous initiatives before committing to a new one. I will look into the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I am concerned about our physical and digital capacity to absorb a new program. I will look into rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, as well as what the booking system records.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,It is always prudent to ensure our foundations are secure before we build upward. I shall examine the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to make sure the people working on this aren't too overwhelmed! I'll look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, and the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to see such thoughtful approaches. To ensure our vision is sustainable and truly viable for the long term, I will look into this year's development allocation and the regional fund tariffs.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Since everyone has selected their areas of focus, I believe we have a comprehensive set of data to review. I will wait for the findings to see how they align with the proposed programs.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. We have covered the financial, operational, and staffing aspects. I believe the data we gather will reveal whether any of the candidates are actually feasible within our current constraints.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. It is a rare delight to see such a balanced distribution of labor. I suspect we shall find that the gap between a proposal's ambition and its actual execution is where the real story lies.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm just so excited to see what we find! I hope we can pick a program that helps the patients and makes our coworkers happy too. I'll be waiting for the results!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, and a little anticipation only adds to the value of the discovery. Let us move forward with a spirit of openness and kindness toward one another.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
