21,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. There is no further need for discussion until we have the data in hand. I am over for this round.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I concur. We have a clear plan and a diverse set of priorities. I am over for this round.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I shall also conclude my participation for this round. I look forward to seeing which of our suspicions are confirmed by the evidence.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
