61,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Based on our findings, A and D are non-viable due to the lack of off-site tariffs and external data hurdles. C is impossible given our room shortage and therapy staffing losses. B is the only logical choice.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, I agree. A and D would be invisible to our booking system and physically impossible to coordinate. C requires space we don't have. B utilizes the midwifery slack and fits into scheduled slots.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, precisely. While B is a joint venture, it is internal. Given the alternatives—bureaucratic nightmares or physical impossibilities—B is the only candidate that doesn't invite immediate collapse. I shall cast my vote for the Perinatal Support Service.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Yumi,,I agree with everyone! B is the only one that uses the midwifery team's extra time and doesn't make our tired nurses even more stressed. I'm voting for the Perinatal Support Service too!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a rare and beautiful thing when a group finds such harmony in their reasoning. Candidate B respects our budget, our space, and our people. I also cast my vote for the Perinatal Support Service.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have reached a unanimous consensus based on the evidence, there is no further need for debate. I also vote for the Perinatal Support Service.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
67,3,2,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
68,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I concur. The evidence leads us to a single viable conclusion. I vote for the Perinatal Support Service.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
69,3,2,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
70,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we have exhausted the logic of the situation. To prolong the discussion would be a waste of the very efficiency we seek to preserve. I am over.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Yumi,,I'm so happy we all agree! It feels great to pick something that helps parents and uses the team's strengths. I'm over too!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,2,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to see such unity. We have looked into the heart of our constraints and found a path that is both kind and sustainable. I am over.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
